    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_32",
      "hash64": "A021CA35E0439D23",
      "text": "Les masques volés par les Adoramis sont\\nconservés au Septemplion, si ça t’intéresse...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_14",
      "hash64": "A028DC35E049DA67",
      "text": "Tu sais, au village, tout l’monde a peur\\ndu Monstre... Mais moi, j’l’aime beaucoup...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_15",
      "hash64": "A028DB35E049D8B4",
      "text": "Il est tellement fort qu’il se fiche que tout\\nl’monde le rejette... Il est vraiment trop cool...\\c\\nJ’l’ai toujours admiré pour ça, même quand\\nj’étais tout petit...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_33",
      "hash64": "A021C935E0439B70",
      "text": "Moi aussi, j’veux devenir cool comme lui.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_34",
      "hash64": "A021D035E043A755",
      "text": "Même à l’école, c’est toujours ma sœur\\nqui s’occupe de tout pour moi...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_35",
      "hash64": "A021CF35E043A5A2",
      "text": "C’est pour ça que j’veux devenir assez fort pour\\nêtre indépendant et m’occuper d’mes soucis...\\r\\ntout seul...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_36",
      "hash64": "A021CE35E043A3EF",
      "text": "Comme ça, j’deviendrai comme le Monstre...\\nEt on pourra p’têt’ devenir amis, lui et moi...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_16",
      "hash64": "A028DE35E049DDCD",
      "text": "Euh... Ah oui ! Faut qu’on prenne une photo ![VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_020_brother_17",
      "hash64": "A028DD35E049DC1A",
      "text": "J’te laisse faire, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
